#The CR noise recordings ARE versioned
# We recorded them and they can't be re-downloaded. What's committed is the 8 kHz
# mono copy (~28 MB), which is what the pipeline consumes. The 48 kHz stereo
# originals (~333 MB) stay in _raw_48k/ - too heavy for git.
data/ruido_costarica/_raw_48k/

#Models: versioned on purpose

#Results: versioned, except the scoring cache
#The tables, metrics JSONs and plots are the deliverable. The per-segment
